Description: Justification pipeline runner for jPipe
 jpipe-runner orchestrates justification pipelines: research workflows where
 Python functions explicitly declare the variables they produce and consume.
 It validates the resulting dependency graph, executes the functions in
 topological order, and can visualise the results with Graphviz.
